0..74 Comment "//! This source refuses a bare constructor name that two imported families"
75..85 Comment "//! share."
86..89 Comment "//!"
90..169 Comment "//! The imported source declares `Red` in `Paint` and in `Light`. A bare use in"
170..205 Comment "//! the importer selects no family."
206..209 Comment "//!"
210..288 Comment "//! The bare use is refused `AmbiguousConstructor`, and the refusal names both"
289..360 Comment "//! families. A use through its family names that family\'s constructor."
361..364 Comment "//!"
